{"n":32,"v":[["Alif, Lâm, Mîm","",[[["الٓمٓ","P","INL|",-1]]]],["La Révélation du Livre, nul doute là-dessus, émane du Seigneur de l'univers","",[[["تَنزِيلُ","N","VN|VF:2|M|NOM",622]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["كِتَٰبِ","N","M|GEN",46]],[["لَا","P","NEG",2]],[["رَيْبَ","N","M|ACC",515]],[["فِي","P","P",3],["هِ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["مِن","P","P",0]],[["رَّبِّ","N","M|GEN",11]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["عَٰلَمِينَ","N","MP|GEN",149]]]],["Diront-ils qu'il (Muhammad) l'a inventé? Ceci est, au contraire, la vérité venant de ton Seigneur pour que tu avertisses un peuple à qui nul avertisseur avant toi n'est venu, afin qu'ils se guident","",[[["أَمْ","P","CONJ",79]],[["يَقُولُ","V","IMPF|VF:1|3MP|MOOD:IND",5],["ونَ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["ٱفْتَرَىٰ","V","PERF|VF:8|3MS",224],["هُ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["بَلْ","P","RET",88]],[["هُوَ","N","PRON|3MS",-1]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["حَقُّ","N","M|NOM",47]],[["مِن","P","P",0]],[["رَّبِّ","N","M|GEN",11],["كَ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MS",-1]],[["لِ","P","PRP|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["تُنذِرَ","V","IMPF|VF:4|2MS|MOOD:SUBJ",247]],[["قَوْمًا","N","M|INDEF|ACC",24]],[["مَّآ","P","NEG",12]],[["أَتَىٰ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",45],["هُم","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["مِّن","P","P",0]],[["نَّذِيرٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",192]],[["مِّن","P","P",0]],[["قَبْلِ","N","GEN",48],["كَ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MS",-1]],[["لَعَلَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",85],["هُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["يَهْتَدُ","V","IMPF|VF:8|3MP|MOOD:IND",273],["ونَ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]]]],["Allah qui a créé en six jours les cieux et la terre, et ce qui est entre eux. Ensuite Il S'est établi «Istawâ» sur le Trône. Vous n'avez, en dehors de Lui, ni allié ni intercesseur. Ne vous rappelez-vous donc pas","",[[["ٱللَّهُ","N","PN|NOM",1]],[["ٱلَّذِى","N","REL|MS",7]],[["خَلَقَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",56]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["سَّمَٰوَٰتِ","N","FP|GEN",34]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["أَرْضَ","N","F|ACC",21]],[["وَ